to the listed price of merchandise. Hence, merchants may embed the shipping fees in the listed price. If embedded, then the shipping
fees are included in our GMV. As a prudential matter aimed at eliminating any influence on our GMV of irregular transactions, we
exclude from our calculation of GMV transactions in certain product categories over certain amounts and transactions by buyers in
certain product categories over a certain amount per day;
